					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					621c
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμιάνθην</span>, 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιάνθην</span> (v. infr.): pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμίασμαι</span> (v. infr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμίαμμαι</span>”
