					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					5.14
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				51.22
			</span></i>; 3sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμίανται</span>”
