				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμίᾱν</span> in 3sg.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
					1927.160
				</span></i>
			, al.: fut.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιᾱσέω</span> in
