					Il.
					4.141
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἔβενος περίδρομος ἐλέφαντα τὸν
					βραχίονα μιαίνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stain, sully</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιάνθησαν ἔθειραι αἵματι καὶ κονίῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.795
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.732
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιάνθην αἵματι μηροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.146
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματι πεσεῖ μιανθείς</span>”
