				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					4.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς μιαίνειν οὔ τις ἀνθρώπων σθένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1044
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἁγνείαν τῶν θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.1.10
			</span></i>; <i>dishonour</i> a woman, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				34.5
			</span></i>, al.:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>incur defilement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				366
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				75
			</span></i>, <u>Berl.Sitzb.</u> ll. cc., etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχήν</span>”
