					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					621c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἄλλης [γῆς] αὐτῷ μεμιασμένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ψυχὴ μεμιασμένη καὶ ἀκάθαρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					81b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιανθέντες τῷ τῆς ἀσεβείας
				μολυσμῷ</span> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>; of ritual defilement in funeral rites, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).593.25
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Iulis</span>).</div>
